==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Undaunted|Misdreavus|57}} from the {{TCG|Undaunted}} expansion.
*'''Infiltrating Inspection''' is based on {{a|Infiltrator}}, an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Misdreavus}} cannot have.
*{{m|Will-O-Wisp}} is a [[move]] in the Pokémon games that Misdreavus can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

